Develop HSER awareness, capability and capacity within the operation and develop talent;
Interface with corporate, regulatory, industry and community bodies on behalf of Hillside where required;
Monitor and report on HSER performance at the operation. Accountable for the accuracy and integrity of all HSER related data;
Ensure effective incident investigations and root cause analysis. Track effective close-out to prevent repeat events and reduce overall HSER risk;
