Job Description
At Experian our Sales Operations Manager is an integral part of our Commercial Finance team aligning planning, execution, and evaluation of the sales activities across our 11 markets. They offer vital support to the EMEA & APAC Region by applying best practice processes to sales management and sales reporting, and clarity to revenue reporting and forecasting and driving profitable growth for the region.
The Sales Operations Manager is a critical part of the Sales and Finance organizations, overseeing the sales reporting (pipeline, wins, losses, conversion), new business forecasting, system management, data quality and overseeing governance within the Sales department. The Sales Operations Manager provides the so-what to regional level sales and revenue reporting demonstrating clear understanding of product, market and client trends.
