Overview & Key Responsibilities
This role is responsible for assisting with the filling of merchant product. The key responsibilities of the role include but are not limited to:
Assist with the filling of merchant product;
Ensuring proper housekeeping and compliance with safety standards at all times;
Ensuring sufficient product supply.
Essential Requirements
A Grade 12 with Maths and Science;
A minimum of 2 - 3 years of experience working in the Gas industry;
Must have basic knowledge of safety procedures and practices;
Must have good verbal & written communication skills;
Be physically fit & able-bodied to perform strenuous work;
Available to work shift system and overtime when required.
